### Abrir con HTTP Client de IntelliJ o REST Client de VS Code.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@studentId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_UUID_DE_RESPUESTA

### Crear: 201 Created y Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "García",
  "email": "maria.garcia@unisalle.edu.co"
}

### Listar: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Consultar por identificador: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/{{studentId}}

### Validación: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"", "lastName":"García", "email":"incorrecto"}

### No encontrado: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Estado del servicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
